g(\\neg F\\land(130>5))=\\neg T=F.\n  \\]\n\n- **(D): False.** The first outer disjunct contains the conjunct\n  \\[\n  \\neg\\neg(6\\le-36)=F,\n  \\]\n  so it is false. The other outer disjunct is\n  \\(\\neg\\neg\\neg(12>-9)=F\\).\n\n- **(E): False.** In its final conjunct, the first disjunct contains\n  \\(\\neg\\neg\\neg(12>-1)=F\\); the second contains the false statement that Norway’s capital is Bergen. Hence that conjunct is false.\n\nFinal answer: **(B)**."}],"phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":"24h","reasoning":{"context":"all_turns","effort":"medium","mode":"standard","summary":null},"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"default","store":false,"temperature":1,"text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"medium"},"tool_choice":"auto","tool_usage":{"image_gen":{"input_tokens":0,"input_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":{"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":0},"total_tokens":0},"web_search":{"num_requests":0}},"tools":[],"top_logprobs":0,"top_p":0.98,"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":1337,"input_tokens_details":{"cache_write_tokens":0,"cached_tokens":1334},"output_tokens":1505,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":1034},"total_tokens":2842},"user":null,"metadata":{}}
